Hi Ricardo and listfolk,

It's a little difficult to work out without seeing the data but it's
possible an issue is that the Sample.Label column is a factor.
aggregate() will try to match the observations to the segments using
their names but they may well not correspond as factors. You may want to
try calling

sega$Sample.Label <- as.character(sega$Sample.Label)
obsa$Sample.Label <- as.character(obsa$Sample.Label)

and see if that resolves the issue (worth inspecting that column to see
if the values are reasonable, NB for example that these labels are case
sensitive). If not please do got ahead and send me the data off-list and
I can take a look (and then we can post a solution to the list).

best,
--dave

