Hi All,
I've got a pretty simple question. I'm running the MRDS package and analyzing double-observer data.  In the output, is there a value given for the total numbers of animals seen in the surveyed region?  I believe there is a value for # of clusters seen, but just a raw count of the number of animals seen during the survey is what I need. This is just a bit more complicated than adding up the numbers from the original datasheet because some observations are matches, so those shouldn't be counted twice.  Any assistance on this would be greatly appreciated!
Thanks,
Mary

